The numbers is a list of 23, 2, 4, 6, and 7.
The divisor is 6.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The flags is a list of 6 zeros.
The firsts is a list of 6 zeros.
Set item 0 of flags to 1.
Set item 0 of firsts to -1.
The running is 0.
The found is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
Set running to running plus item spot of numbers.
Set running to running modulo divisor.
The key is running.
If item key of flags is 0, set item key of flags to 1, set item key of firsts to spot.
The stretch is spot minus item key of firsts.
If item key of flags is 1 and stretch is at least 2, set found to 1.
If found is 1, stop.

If found is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
